## 4. LeetCode #142 – Linked List Cycle II

**Concepts:** Floyd's Cycle Detection, Fast and Slow Pointers

```java
public class Solution {
    public ListNode detectCycle(ListNode head) {
        if (head == null || head.next == null) {
            return null;
        }

        ListNode slow = head;
        ListNode fast = head;

        while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {
            slow = slow.next;
            fast = fast.next.next;

            if (slow == fast) {
                ListNode start = head;

                while (start != slow) {
                    start = start.next;
                    slow = slow.next;
                }

                return start;
            }
        }

        return null;
    }
}
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

