## 5. LeetCode #143 – Reorder List

**Concepts:** Slow and Fast Pointers, Linked List Reversal, Merging Two Lists

```java
class Solution {
    public void reorderList(ListNode head) {
        if (head == null || head.next == null) {
            return;
        }

        // Find the middle of the list
        ListNode slow = head;
        ListNode fast = head;

        while (fast.next != null && fast.next.next != null) {
            slow = slow.next;
            fast = fast.next.next;
        }

        // Reverse the second half
        ListNode second = slow.next;
        slow.next = null;

        ListNode prev = null;

        while (second != null) {
            ListNode next = second.next;
            second.next = prev;
            prev = second;
            second = next;
        }

        // Merge both halves
        ListNode first = head;
        second = prev;

        while (second != null) {
            ListNode next1 = first.next;
            ListNode next2 = second.next;

            first.next = second;
            second.next = next1;

            first = next1;
            second = next2;
        }
    }
}
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

